{"c":[{"id":"63ba1e5d1c252753","sum":"2.0.0: explicit storage_compatibility_version (even latest) raises ConnectionException on a second plain in-process connect. v1.0.0 at v2.0.0 stays v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 reads and writes it. plain 489 MiB, zstd 290 MiB; ILIKE 142/196 ms; sum(length) 27/97 ms; 50 rows 3 ms; copy 5.3 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T001340Z-ee4e725d1cf8c7b2","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: any explicit storage_compatibility_version (even 'latest') makes a plain connect to the same path in the same process raise ConnectionException. A v1.0.0 file opened with 'v2.0.0' keeps v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 still reads and writes it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001341Z-996aef6d584dc9d1","text":"Live tables copied 2026-10-22 into v2.0.0 files: plain 489 MiB (text Uncompressed), zstd on text+tool_input 290 MiB. ILIKE over text 142 vs 196 ms, sum(length(text)) 27 vs 97 ms, latest 50 rows 3 ms both. Copy 5.3 s both.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"888f9caf1291b966","sum":"Puck ce16489 exited 0: make sync, no --with; copy stayed v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 wrote; no nanobind. Released SQL is immutable; 0003 returns shipped; no runner records a version unrun. 2.0.0: 0003 needs INSTALL/LOAD vss, no autoload; kill after 0003 reopens without vss; 0009 drops index.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T010854Z-5c910d697bfc5d76","text":"Puck shadow of constrain-size-as-best-we-can at ce16489 (fresh clone, make sync, no --with) exited 0: every phase passed, copy stayed v1.0.0+, DuckDB 1.5.4 wrote it, no nanobind line.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T012807Z-7941fa66d7075fa2","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: released migrations are never rewritten; 0003 returns as shipped. No runner rule may record a version unrun. DuckDB 2.0.0: released 0003 needs explicit INSTALL/LOAD vss (no autoload); a kill after 0003 reopens without vss and 0009 drops the index.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
